id: unique-technique
name: Unique Technique
talentCategory: technique
prerequisites: Favored Technique
# (1) "select a Profile of the same Foundation as your Favored Technique" - asked as it is gained; changeable on its Options tab.
choose: uniqueProfile
description: >
  You’ve managed to make your special technique even more unique, creating something truly your own.
text: >
  Unique Technique: You’ve managed to make your special technique even more unique, creating something truly your own.
  –Prerequisites: Favored Technique
  (1)-[Ruling]: Upon gaining this Talent, select a Profile of the same Foundation as your Favored Technique. This becomes known as your ‘Unique Profile’.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When using your Favored Technique, you may apply the Multi-Profile Super Profile onto your Favored Technique. If you do, you must select your Unique Profile for its effects.

---

[passive]
# (2) Asked as the Favored Technique is declared, once a Round: Multi-Profile with your Unique Profile - its KP paid, what that
# Profile hands out with it; a Super Profile it has already, replaced, as Neko Mimicry's (use-maneuver.mjs
# uniqueTechniqueMulti).
allow unique.multiProfile;
